From: Harvi654 <202698022+Harvi654@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] glu32: Implement NURBS curves.

AI-assisted (Claude, Codex), original code; LGPL-2.1-or-later. Not submitted
upstream.

Curve-only NURBS support, AI-assisted; LGPL-2.1-or-later.
Original implementation from the public de Boor recurrence; no Mesa/SGI code.
In functional series following Windows reference checks and local CAD L4 validation.

Header added on 2026-11-11, before winum-11.20-1 (the patch body is
unchanged). Problem, cause, Windows behaviour and validation:
docs/patches/glu32-nurbs-curves.md.

